  "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared an **^^Unlimited Spell^^** ability for this unit": "Una vez por turno (ejército), Reacción: Has declarado una habilidad de **^^Unlimited Spell^^** para esta unidad",
  "This unit cannot be picked to be the target of enemy units that are more than 9\" away from it.": "",
