  "**^^Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** only. Your hero's non-**Companion** melee weapons gain **Crit (Mortal)**.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Firestealer Hammers** is 4.": "",
  "**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):\r\nCover, Impassable**": "**Las siguientes habilidades universales de escenografía se aplican a este elemento de escenografía (Terrain, 1.2):\nCover, Impassable**",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the unmodified charge roll. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "Tira un número de dados igual a la tirada de carga sin modificar. Por cada 4+, inflige 1 de daño mortal al objetivo.",
  "Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's **Dawnrider Lances and Blades** if it charged in the same turn.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Retira esta unidad del campo de batalla y vuelve a colocarla en el campo de batalla a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Pick an enemy **^^Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** unit that this unit passed across this phase to be the target.": "",
  "Remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Stoneheart Worldhammer** is 3.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Celennar's Moonbright Talons** is 3.": "Mientras esta unidad tenga 10 o más puntos de daño, la característica de Attacks de **Celennar's Moonbright Talons** es 3.",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Aelementor Colossal Weapon** is 3.": "",
  "The Damage characteristic of this unit's **Bow of the Wind's Vengeance** is 3 for attacks that target **^^Monsters^^**.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, it can move 2D6\". It can pass through models in enemy units but must end that move in combat.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again anywhere on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Add 1 to save rolls for friendly **^^Vanari Infantry^^** units while they are contesting the same objective as this unit.": "",
  "For the rest of the battle, add 1 to casting rolls for units (friendly and enemy) while they are within 3\" of the target.": "",
  "While this unit's **Myari Lightcaller** is on the battlefield, it has **^^Wizard (1)^^** and the **^^Scinari^^** keyword.": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it this turn by this unit's shooting attacks  to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga a la que se le hayan asignado puntos de daño este turno por los ataques de disparo de esta unidad.",
  "You can re-roll charge rolls for friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units while they are wholly within 6\" of this unit.": "",
  "Pick any number of different visible enemy units within 18\" of this unit to be the targets, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Pick this unit and up to 2 other friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the targets.": "",
  "**^^Aelementor^^** only. Your hero gains the **^^Aelf^^** keyword and the **Hyshian Blade** weapon from the starting warscroll.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks made by enemy units that are contesting that objective.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's attacks and subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target this unit.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn:\r\n• Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the target's melee weapons.\r\n• The target cannot make pile-in moves.": "",
  "Roll a dice for each model in the wall of blades that is within 3\" of the target. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "",
  "**Heal (D6)** this unit. Then, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "While this unit is wholly within the combat range of another friendly unit, both this unit and that friendly unit have **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "",
  "Roll a D3. Add 2 to the roll if the target charged this turn. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, attacks that target that friendly unit cannot score critical hits (treat them as regular hits instead).": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit that has no more than 1 model\r\nand is within 18\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll\r\nof 2D6.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "This unit cannot use this ability if it is in combat. Pick a friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** unit that is in combat to be the target.": "",
  "Once Per Turn, Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this terrain feature": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, each target can use a **^^Run^^** ability and still use **^^Shoot^^** and/or **^^Charge^^** abilities later in the turn.": "",
  "Pick an objective that you do not control that is within 18\" of and visible to this unit's **Myari Lightcaller**, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1\" of the target, within 1\" of an enemy unit and in combat. This unit has charged.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Lumineth Realm‑lords Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "This unit can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, this unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "While a visible friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** unit is wholly within 12\" of this unit, it can use the 'Rally' command even if it is in combat.": "",
  "While any friendly **^^Scinari Heroes^^** are wholly within this unit's combat range, both this unit and those friendly units have **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "Mientras haya algún **^^Scinari Heroes^^** amigo totalmente dentro del alcance de combate de esta unidad, tanto esta unidad como esas unidades amigas tienen **^^Ward (5+)^^**.",
  "While you have 2 or more instances of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** depicted on your **battle scripture**, this unit's Save characteristic is 3+.": "",
  "Add 6\" to the Range characteristic of this unit's **Starshard Bolts** while it is wholly within 12\" of any friendly **Vanari Auralan Sentinels** units.": "",
  "If you depicted **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River** this battle round, pick a friendly **^^Ydrilan^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if the target is a **^^Monster^^**. On a 3+, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Each time a friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.": "Cada vez que una unidad amiga **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad use la orden 'Rally', puedes hacer 3 tiradas de reagrupamiento de D6 adicionales.",
  "For the rest of the turn, add 6\" to the Range characteristic of this unit's **Auralan Bows** but subtract 1 from hit rolls for this unit's shooting attacks.": "",
  "If this unit has not charged this turn, ignore the effect of the **Charge (+1 Damage)** ability for combat attacks made by enemy units that target this unit.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Lumineth Realm‑lords^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit and not in combat to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's **Sunmental Blades** for each instance of **Varinor, Rune of Strength** depicted on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Vanari^^** keyword, has a save characteristic of 4+, and gains the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units": "",
  "Add this **^^Manifestation^^**'s **arcane charge points** to the casting roll or unbinding roll. Then, reset this **^^Manifestation^^**'s arcane charge points to 0.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Scinari Mage^^** and **^^Wizard (1)^^** keywords, the 'Shining Blades' ability, and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Vanari^^** units": "",
  "If this terrain feature does not have a Shrine Guardian, pick a friendly **^^Lumineth Realm‑lords Infantry Hero^^** within 3\" of it and not in combat to be the target.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Firestealer Hammers** for each instance of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** depicted on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** or **^^Unbind^^** ability for a **^^Lumineth Realm-lords Wizard^^** within 3\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**": "",
  "**^^Aelementor^^** only. Add the 'Blasted by the Elements' ability to your hero's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade if your hero has another **^^Rampage^^** ability.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Stoneheart Worldhammer** for each instance of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** depicted on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "Ignore negative modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls for this unit's attacks. In addition, ignore negative modifiers to the characteristics of this unit's melee weapons.": "",
  "While friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units are wholly within 12\" of this unit, add 1 to casting rolls for those units and add 1 to wound rolls for those units' attacks.": "",
  "If you depicted **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** this battle round, add 3 to the control scores of friendly **^^Alarith^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "While you have 2 or more instances of **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** depicted on your **battle scripture**, add 6\" to the Range characteristic of this unit's **Windcharger Bows**.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **Vanari Auralan Wardens** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the wall of blades. Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with the wall of blades to be the target.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Hurakan^^** and **^^Wizard (1)^^** keywords, the 'Gale-force Arrows' ability, and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Hurakan^^** or **^^Vanari^^** units": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Alarith^^** and **^^Wizard (1)^^** keywords, the 'Immovable Defenders' ability, and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Alarith^^** or **^^Vanari^^** units": "",
  "For the rest of the turn:\r\n• This unit has **^^Strike-last^^**.\r\n• If the unmodified hit roll for an attack that targets this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll and subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Ydrilan^^** and **^^Wizard (1)^^** keywords, the 'Flow with the Current' ability, and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Ydrilan^^** or **^^Vanari^^** units": "",
  "This unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "Esta unidad puede usar habilidades de **^^Charge^^** aunque haya usado una habilidad de **^^Retreat^^** en el mismo turno. Además, esta unidad no recibe daño mortal por habilidades de **^^Retreat^^**.",
  "If you depicted **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** this battle round, ranged weapons used by friendly **^^Hurakan^^** units have **Crit (Auto-wound)** while they are wholly within 12\" Of this unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, while that enemy unit is in combat with this unit, all attacks made by models in that unit within this unit's combat range must target this unit.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, when making charge rolls for the target(s), add 1 to the number of dice rolled, to a maximum or 3, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the charge roll.": "",
  "If this unit used a **^^Shoot^^** ability this phase, this unit can move D6\". Add 2 to the roll for each instance of **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** depicted on your **battle scripture**. It cannot end that move in combat.": "",
  "Replace 1 instance of a rune on your **battle scripture** with 1 of the following:\r\n• **Varinor, Rune of Strength**\r\n• **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River**\r\n• **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain**\r\n• **Oreali, Rune of the Wind**": "",
  "Unmodified casting rolls for friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units wholly within 12\" Of this unit that contain 2 or more rolls of 1 or 2 are miscast. This unit cannot end a move within 5\" of a **^^Manfestation^^**.": "",
  "Pick 1 of your hero's melee weapons. That weapon has **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is one of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**": "",
  "If this terrain feature has a Shrine Guardian that was not placed on it this turn, set up the Shrine Guardian on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer a Shrine Guardian.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, each time a non-**^^Fly^^** unit (friendly or enemy) that is contesting the target objective uses a **^^Move^^** ability, inflict D6 mortal damage on that unit after that ability has been resolved.": "",
  "If Ellania leads, until the start of your next turn, add 1 to this unit's power level and it has **^^Ward (4+)^^**. \r\nIf Ellathor leads, until the start of your next turn, add the current battle round number to the Damage characteristic of **Altairi**.": "",
  "Each time a unit (friendly or enemy) successfully casts a spell while it is within 12\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**, give this **^^Manifestation^^** 1 **arcane charge point**.\r\nThis **^^Manifestation^^** can have a maximum of 6 **arcane charge points**.": "",
  "This unit's **Tzul** is a token. After setting up this unit on the battlefield for the first time, place its **Tzul** next to it.\r\n• While this unit's **Tzul** is next to it, it has **^^Fly^^**.\r\n• While this unit's **Thyrielle** is on the battlefield, it has **^^Wizard (1)^^**.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Wizard (1)^^**, **^^Scinari^^**, and **^^Vanari^^** keywords, has a Save characteristic of 4+, and gains the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units\r\nIn addition, replace your hero's **Hyshian Blade** with an **Eclipsian Blade**.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, the first time an enemy unit within 18\" of this unit uses a command, unless your opponent spends 1 additional command point, the command has no effect, it still counts as having been used and the command points spent to use the command are still lost.": "",
  "If that spell is successfully cast, roll a dice. On a 4+, after resolving the effect of that spell, this unit can immediately cast that spell a second time using the same casting roll. Do not count the second spell towards the number of **^^Spell^^** abilities this unit can use this turn.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each enemy unit within 6\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. If an enemy unit has at least 3 mortal damage inflicted on it by this ability this turn, it has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice each time you declare a command for another friendly unit within 6\" of this unit. On a 4+, unless you spend 1 additional command point to use that command, the command has no effect, it still counts as having been used and the command points spent to use the command are still lost.": "",
  "Add the **Lightcourser's Horns and Claws** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 14\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 7.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "While a friendly unit with a Health characteristic of 10 or less is wholly inside the ring formed by this **^^Manifestation^^**:\r\n• That unit is not visible to enemy units that are not within its combat range.\r\n• Enemy abilities that would target this unit must target this **^^Manifestation^^** instead.": "",
  "Add 1 to casting rolls and banishment rolls for friendly **^^Lumineth Realm‑lords Wizards^^** while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.\r\nIn addition, this unit can use **^^Spell^^** abilities from the Lore of Hysh, the Lore of Awakened Realms, and the warscrolls of all friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords Wizards^^** on the battlefield.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units.\r\nIf you picked to depict **Ydriliqui, Rune of the River** on your **battle scripture** this battle round, you can instead set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "If this unit is picked to be a target of the 'Depict Rune' ability, for the rest of that battle round, when resolving the damage sequence for a friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** unit while it is wholly within 12\" of this unit, if you spend rage dice as part of the 'Fight Through the Pain' ability, remove 1 damage point from that unit's damage pool on a 2+ instead of a 3+.": "",
  "The first time this unit would be destroyed, before removing it from play, it is not destroyed and any remaining damage points inflicted on it have no effect. Then, **Heal (1)** this unit and for the rest of the battle:\r\n• Ignore modifiers (positive and negative) to save rolls and ward rolls for this unit.\r\n• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^** and **^^Fly^^**.\r\n• This unit cannot be healed.": "",
  "Depict a rune of your choice on your **battle scripture**.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *This allows you to have that rune depicted earlier in the **battle scripture** for the purposes of other abilities. Do not resolve the effect of the 'Depict Rune' ability as part of this ability.\r\nThere is a smaller diamond in the battle scripture diamond in the Rules Reference where you can record this extra rune.*": "",
  "For the rest of the battle, the target is **gripped** until this unit is destroyed, the target **breaks free** or you pick a different target for this spell.\r\nWhile the target is **gripped**, each time it uses a **^^Move^^** ability, your opponent must roll a dice as a reaction and add their **fury level** to the roll. On a 7+, the target breaks free. Otherwise, that **^^Move^^** ability has no effect.": "",
  "If this unit is destroyed and if a friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords Wizard^^** successfully casts a **^^Summon^^** spell, instead of resolving the effect of that **^^Summon^^** spell, you can set up a replacement unit for this unit more than 9\" from all enemy units and wholly within 12\" of the unit that used that **^^Summon^^** spell. This ability is still in effect even if this unit is not on the battlefield.": "",
  "If your opponent's **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• Each time this unit is picked to use the 'Eruption of Fury' ability, if you spend 1 **rage dice** as part of that ability, it counts as 3 **rage dice**.\r\n• This unit can be picked to use the 'Eruption of Fury' ability even if you have already used it this turn.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following:\r\n***Magical Supremacy:*** Instead of making a casting roll for the next **^^Spell^^** ability used by this unit this turn, you can use a value of 12 for the roll that cannot be modified.\r\n***Drain Power***: Pick a visible enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 18\" of this unit to be the target. Subtract 1 from the target's power level, to a minimum of 0, until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Non-**^^Vanari^^**, non-**^^Scinari^^** only. Replace your hero's weapons with the **Aelementor Ranged Weapon** and **Swirling Debris** weapons.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 14\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 8.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.\r\n• Replace the **^^Aelf^^** keyword with the **^^Aelementor^^** keyword.": "",
  "While a visible friendly **^^Hurakan^^** unit is wholly within 12\" of this unit:\r\n• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit's warscroll.\r\n• If that unit is picked to be the target of the 'Depict Rune' ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "While a visible friendly **^^Vanari^^** unit is wholly within 12\" of this unit:\r\n• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of **Varinor, Rune of Strength** depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit's warscroll.\r\n• If that unit is picked to be the target of the 'Depict Rune' ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of **Varinor, Rune of Strength** on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "Place this unit's **Tzul** next to this unit.\r\n• You can move the target up to D3\".\r\n• Then, if this unit is within 6\" of the target, you can move this unit up to D6\". It cannot end that move in combat.\r\nAdd 2\" to the distance each unit can move for each instance of **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** depicted on your battle scripture.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *If your opponent would prefer to move their own models, pre-measure the distance and indicate where they should move their models to.*": "",
  "While a visible friendly **^^Alarith^^** unit is wholly within 12\" of this unit:\r\n• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit's warscroll.\r\n• If that unit is picked to be the target of the 'Depict Rune' ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "If this unit is **^^Alarith^^**, replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain**.\r\nIf this unit is **^^Hurakan^^**, replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with **Oreali, Rune of the Wind**.\r\nIf this unit is **^^Ydrilan^^**, replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River**.\r\nIf this unit is **^^Scinari^^** or **^^Vanari^^**, pick 1 of the runes above and replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with that rune.": "",
  "Non-**^^Vanari^^**, non-**^^Scinari^^** only. Replace your hero's weapons with the **Aelementor Colossal Weapon** weapon and add the 'Battle Damaged' ability to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 3+.\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 14.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.\r\n• Replace the **^^Aelf^^** keyword with the **^^Aelementor^^** keyword.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat with the target, the corresponding effect below applies until the start of your next turn. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, the corresponding effect below applies until the start of your next turn:\r\n***Holder of Forbidden Treasures*:** If the target has an artefact of power, that artefact of power has no effect.\r\n***An Insignificant Underling*:** If the target does not have an artefact of power, other than the **Companion** weapon ability, weapon abilities for the target's combat attacks have no effect.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following runes:\r\n• **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River**\r\n• **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain**\r\n• **Oreali, Rune of the Wind**\r\nFor the rest of the battle, while a visible friendly unit is wholly within 12\" of this unit:\r\n• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of that rune depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit's warscroll.\r\n• If that unit is picked to be the target of the 'Depict Rune' ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of that rune on your **battle scripture**.": "",
  "While this terrain feature has a Shrine Guardian:\r\n• This terrain feature has a Move characteristic of 6\" and can use non-command non-**^^Charge^^** **^^Move^^** abilities as if it were a unit. It cannot end a **^^Move^^** ability within the combat range of an enemy unit.\r\n• The Shrine Guardian cannot use **^^Move^^** abilities and remains on this terrain feature each time it moves.\r\n• Instead of measuring range or visibility to the Shrine Guardian, measure to this terrain feature instead.\r\n• All attacks that would target the Shrine Guardian target this terrain feature instead.\r\n• If this terrain feature is destroyed, before removing it from the battlefield, inflict D3 mortal damage on the Shrine Guardian. Then, set up the Shrine Guardian on the battlefield wholly within 3\" of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer a Shrine Guardian. If it is not possible to set up the Shrine Guardian, it is slain.": ""
}
